{
  "key": 18211,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_ClefairyCameFromMoon",
      "en_US": [
        "Clefairy came from the moon.\n",
        "That’s what the rumor is.\r",
        "They appeared after Moon Stones\n",
        "fell on Mt. Moon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_DidYouCheckOutMuseum",
      "en_US": "Did you check out the Museum?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_ReallyYouHaveToGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Really?\n",
        "You absolutely have to go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_ThisIsTheMuseum",
      "en_US": [
        "This is it, the Museum.\r",
        "You have to pay to get in, but it’s\n",
        "worth it. See you around!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_BrockOnlySeriousTrainerHere",
      "en_US": [
        "There aren’t many serious Pokémon\n",
        "Trainers here.\r",
        "They’re all like Bug Catchers,\n",
        "you know, just hobbyists.\r",
        "But Pewter Gym’s Brock isn’t like\n",
        "that, not one bit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_DoYouKnowWhatImDoing",
      "en_US": [
        "Psssst!\n",
        "Do you know what I’m doing?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_SprayingRepelToKeepWildMonsOut",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m spraying Repel to keep wild\n",
        "Pokémon out of my garden!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_BrocksLookingForChallengersFollowMe",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re a Trainer, right?\r",
        "BROCK’s looking for new\n",
        "challengers. Follow me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_GoTakeOnBrock",
      "en_US": [
        "If you have the right stuff,\n",
        "go take on Brock!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_MuseumOfScience",
      "en_US": "Pewter Museum of Science"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_CallPoliceIfInfoOnThieves",
      "en_US": [
        "Notice!\r",
        "Thieves have been stealing Pokémon\n",
        "fossils from Mt. Moon.\r",
        "Please call the Pewter Police if\n",
        "you have any information."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_GymSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Pewter City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Brock\f",
        "The Rock-Solid Pokémon Trainer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_TrainerTipsEarningEXP",
      "en_US": [
        "Trainer Tips\r",
        "All Pokémon that appear in battle,\n",
        "however briefly, earn EXP Points."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_CitySign",
      "en_US": [
        "Pewter City\n",
        "A Stone Gray City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_WerentThoseFossilsAmazing",
      "en_US": [
        "Weren’t those fossils from Mt. Moon\n",
        "amazing?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_ThatsRightItsHardWork",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s right!\n",
        "It’s hard work!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_OhPlayer",
      "en_US": "Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_AskedToDeliverThis",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m glad I caught up to you.\n",
        "I’m Prof. Oak’s Aide.\r",
        "I’ve been asked to deliver this,\n",
        "so here you go."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_ReceivedRunningShoesFromAide",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the\n",
        "RUNNING Shoes from the Aide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_SwitchedShoesWithRunningShoes",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} switched shoes with the\n",
        "RUNNING Shoes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_ExplainRunningShoes",
      "en_US": [
        "Press the B Button to run.\n",
        "But only where there’s room to run!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_MustBeGoingBackToLab",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, I must be going back to\n",
        "the Lab.\r",
        "Bye-bye!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_PewterCity_Text_RunningShoesLetterFromMom",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a letter attached…\r",
        "Dear {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0},\r",
        "Here is a pair of Running Shoes\n",
        "for my beloved challenger.\r",
        "Remember, I’ll always cheer for\n",
        "you! Don’t ever give up!\r",
        "From Mom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMove",
      "en_US": "Which move should I teach?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon should learn\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_TypeTutor_Text_Taught",
      "en_US": "Well done! Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_TypeTutor_Text_Bye",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time. A Leader\n",
        "never stops learning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
